ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Desdemona, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Desdemona]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Desdemona]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Hamlet:
 Are you better than nothing?
Desdemona:
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Hamlet:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Desdemona:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Juliet]
Hamlet: You are as good as Hamlet.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Romeo]
Hamlet: You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Othello]
Hamlet: You are as good as Hamlet.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of Juliet and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act III: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of Lady Macbeth and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big hero and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Ophelia and Cordelia]
Ophelia:
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Ophelia and a big hero.
Cordelia:
 Am I as good as a hero?
Ophelia:
 If so, let us proceed to scene III.
 Let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
 Open your heart.
 Let us proceed to scene V.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between nothing and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
